    <Markdown>
## How I feel about writing — all 26 statements

1. Writing is a skill I want to get better at. — **{{@s01.value}}**
2. It is frustrating to have to write about a subject I did not choose. — **{{@s02.value}}**
3. Writing is usually boring for me. — **{{@s03.value}}**
4. I worry that other people will criticize my writing. — **{{@s04.value}}**
5. I like to write outside of school. — **{{@s05.value}}**
6. It upsets me when I get low grades on a writing assignment. — **{{@s06.value}}**
7. I am too impatient to spend a lot of time writing. — **{{@s07.value}}**
8. I get so involved in my writing that I often lose track of time. — **{{@s08.value}}**
9. Writing helps me learn. — **{{@s09.value}}**
10. I feel it is important to know how to write well. — **{{@s10.value}}**
11. I prefer writing when it isn't required. — **{{@s11.value}}**
12. I like getting lots of shares or likes when I post something I have written. — **{{@s12.value}}**
13. There are some subjects that I really enjoy writing about. — **{{@s13.value}}**
14. I dislike writing. — **{{@s14.value}}**
15. I find it difficult to communicate my ideas through writing. — **{{@s15.value}}**
16. I like it when people compliment my writing skills. — **{{@s16.value}}**
17. I feel confident when I am writing. — **{{@s17.value}}**
18. It is important that I get a good grade on a writing assignment. — **{{@s18.value}}**
19. When I write, I create content that I can be proud of. — **{{@s19.value}}**
20. Writing feels really hard. — **{{@s20.value}}**
21. I usually enjoy writing in school. — **{{@s21.value}}**
22. I find writing interesting. — **{{@s22.value}}**
23. I enjoy writing most when I get to decide what to write about. — **{{@s23.value}}**
24. I understand things better when I write about them. — **{{@s24.value}}**
25. There are some kinds of writing that I really like. — **{{@s25.value}}**
26. I like it when I can focus and my writing flows. — **{{@s26.value}}**
    </Markdown>

